plugin/data/corrections.json contains short quotations from public agent skill
repositories, each identifying the line a correction is about. Every correction
names the repository it quotes ("repo"), and that repository's license covers
the quoted text. At the time of writing these are:
  - TerminalSkills/skills (Apache License 2.0)
  - aj-geddes/useful-ai-prompts (MIT License)
  - HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard (MIT License)

